[Q4] 新严格链
   L1 [T] phi 严格递减, phi(0)=1, phi(2)=0  => nu_B 由 phi(w)e^{-Bw}dw 给出
   L2 [T] P(w>t) <= e^{-Bt}  (C1 = 1, 不是 1.582)
   L3 [T] E[w^k] <= k!/B^k   => Var(w) <= 2/B^2
   L4 [T] Var(h) = min_c E[(h-c)^2] <= E[(h-1/(3B))^2]
         = E[Delta^2]/9 + (2/3)E[e Delta] + E[e^2],  Delta=w-1/B, e=h-w/3
         <= D/9 + (2/3)sqrt(E[e^2] D) + E[e^2]
   L5 [T/C] E[w] >= W_lo = (1-Kbar/Zlo)/B  (Kbar: 分部积分 + |phi'|<=pi/6 on [0,1])
   L6 [T/C] E[e^2] <= E[w^4]/144 = 1/(6B^4)

